<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vanilla Pay International</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        /* Section "Pourquoi nous?" */
        .why-us-section {
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #1D1832, #5A9BD4);
            color: white;
            padding: 8rem 0 3rem;
            position: relative;
            margin-top: -80px;
            z-index: 5;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .why-us-section h2 {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            top: 50px;
        }

        .why-us-phones {
            position: relative;
            margin-left: 1rem;
            margin-top: 8rem;
        }

        .phone-1 {
            top: 70px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: 600px;
        }

        .phone-2 {
            position: absolute;
            top: 40px;
            left: -300px;
            z-index: 1;
            width: 800px;
        }

        .benefit-container {
            gap: 26rem;
        }
        
        .benefits {
            margin-top: 15rem;
            margin-left: -10rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .benefit-card {
            width: 400px;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .benefit-number {
            font-size: 5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #5A9BD4;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .benefit-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .benefit-desc {
            color: #e0e0e0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .info-bubble {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            margin-right: -180px;
            max-width: 700px;
            padding: 3rem 2.5rem 2rem 3rem;
            background-color: white;
            color: #333;
            border-top-left-radius: 12rem;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 12rem;
            border-top-right-radius: 0;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 0;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .download_container {
            margin-left: 12rem;
            display: inline-block;
            height: 60px; 
            margin-top: 100px;           
        }

        .download-button {
            background-color: white;
            color: #1D1832;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            white-space: nowrap;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            height: auto;
        }

        .download-button:hover {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .download-icon {
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        /* Media Queries pour rendre la page responsive */
        
        /* Grand écran */
        @media (min-width: 1441px) {
            .phone-1 {
                width: 650px;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 850px;
                left: -320px;
            }
        }
        
        /* Écrans moyens et petits desktops */
        @media (max-width: 1440px) {
            .benefit-container {
                gap: 20rem;
            }
            .phone-1 {
                width: 550px;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 750px;
                left: -280px;
            }
            .info-bubble {
                max-width: 600px;
                margin-right: -150px;
            }
        }
        
        /* Petits desktops et grandes tablettes */
        @media (max-width: 1200px) {
            .info-bubble {
                max-width: 500px;
                margin-right: -100px;
                border-top-left-radius: 8rem;
                border-bottom-left-radius: 8rem;
                padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
            }
            .benefit-container {
                gap: 15rem;
            }
            .benefits {
                margin-left: -5rem;
            }
            .phone-1 {
                width: 450px;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 600px;
                left: -200px;
            }
            .benefit-card {
                width: 350px;
            }
            .download_container {
                margin-left: 8rem;
            }
        }
        
        /* Tablettes */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .why-us-section h2 {
                font-size: 4rem;
                top: 30px;
            }
            .info-bubble {
                position: relative;
                margin-right: 0;
                max-width: 100%;
                border-radius: 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
                margin-top: 6rem;
            }
            .phone-1 {
                width: 400px;
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
                display: block;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 500px;
                left: -120px;
                top: 60px;
            }
            .benefits {
                margin-top: 5rem;
                margin-left: 0;
            }
            .benefit-container {
                gap: 2rem;
            }
            .benefit-card {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .download_container {
                margin-left: 0;
                margin-top: 50px;
            }
            .why-us-phones {
                margin-top: 4rem;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
        
        /* Petites tablettes et grands mobiles */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .why-us-section {
                padding-top: 6rem;
            }
            .why-us-section h2 {
                font-size: 3.5rem;
                text-align: center;
                top: 0;
            }
            .phone-1 {
                width: 350px;
                top: 40px;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 450px;
                left: -100px;
                top: 30px;
            }
            .benefit-number {
                font-size: 4rem;
            }
            .benefit-title {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
            .why-us-phones {
                margin-top: 3rem;
                margin-left: 0;
            }
        }
        
        /* Mobiles */
        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .why-us-section {
                margin-top: -40px;
                padding-top: 4rem;
            }
            .why-us-section h2 {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }
            .why-us-phones {
                margin-top: 2rem;
                overflow: hidden;
                max-width: 100%;
            }
            .phone-1 {
                width: 250px;
                top: 30px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 300px;
                left: -50px;
                top: 20px;
            }
            .benefit-card {
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            .benefit-number {
                font-size: 3.5rem;
            }
            .benefit-container {
                gap: 1rem;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
            }
            .info-bubble {
                padding: 1.5rem;
                margin-top: 4rem;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            .download_container {
                margin-top: 20px;
                justify-content: center;
                display: flex;
            }
        }
        
        /* Très petits mobiles */
        @media (max-width: 375px) {
            .why-us-section h2 {
                font-size: 2.3rem;
            }
            .phone-1 {
                width: 200px;
            }
            .phone-2 {
                width: 250px;
                left: -40px;
            }
            .benefit-number {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }
            .benefit-title {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            .benefit-desc {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
 <!-- Section "Pourquoi nous?" -->
 <div class="why-us-section py-18 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative">
        <!-- Info bubble -->
        <div class="info-bubble">
            <p>En adoptant notre solution, vous aidez les entreprises dans les pays en développement à leurs inclusions financières. Les paiements numériques leur permettent d'emprunter plus à la banque et d'investir encore mieux pour agrandir leurs activités.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row">
            <!-- Left side - Title and phones -->
            <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-10 md:mb-0">
                <h2 class="text-7xl font-bold">
                    Pourquoi <span class="text-[#5A9BD4]">nous?</span>
                </h2>
                
                <!-- Phones display -->
                <div class="why-us-phones">
                    <img src="/assets/images/5c009976-fa00-4b1e-8935-ebb766b32d6f.png" alt="Screenshot application 1" class="phone-1">
                    <img src="/assets/images/smart 1.png" alt="Screenshot application 2" class="phone-2">
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right side - 3 benefits -->
            <div class="md:w-1/2 pl-0 md:pl-16 benefits">
                <!-- Grid container for benefits -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 benefit-container">
                    <!-- Benefit 1 -->
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="benefit-number">01</div>
                        <h3 class="benefit-title">Sécurisé :</h3>
                        <p class="benefit-desc">nos plateformes respectent les standards internationaux PCI-DSS. Nous facilitons vos paiements, nous ne gardons pas votre argent. Les transactions sont assurées par des PSP partenaires reconnus en Europe. Les entreprises partenaires.<a href="#" class="text-[#5A9BD4] hover:underline">voir plus</a></p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Benefit 2 -->
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="benefit-number">02</div>
                        <h3 class="benefit-title">Pratique :</h3>
                        <p class="benefit-desc">vous pouvez savoir à tout moment dans l'app, combien vous avez dépensé et dans quelle catégorie (hôtels, restau, loisirs, déplacement, autres activités.)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Grid container for benefit 3 and download button -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
                    <!-- Benefit 3 -->
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="benefit-number">03</div>
                        <h3 class="benefit-title">Simple :</h3>
                        <p class="benefit-desc">scannez le qrcode, saisissez le montant à payer en monnaie locale du pays et validez.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Download button -->
                    <div class="flex download_container">
                        <a href="#" class="download-button">
                            <svg class="download-icon w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path>
                            </svg>
                            Télécharger l'app
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>